  "title": "Mexican Roll Ups",
  "description": "A tasty alternative to sandwiches for a lunchbox or picnic. Roast beef, chopped tomatoes, bell peppers, and seasonings are rolled in whole wheat tortillas and wrapped in tinfoil. East to transport, and neat to eat.",
  "authors": [
    "Robyn Webb"
